&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;对于上述内容，存在两点需要说明：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Parallel Computing</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/hpc/parallel-computing/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 Jan 2024 23:41:59 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/hpc/parallel-computing/</guid><category domain="https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/categories/hpc/">HPC</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="law"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Law&lt;/span&gt;
